#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This section explores how to use `qiskit-ibm-catalog` to list programs "
"available in Qiskit Serverless, pass inputs into these programs, run them "
"remotely, check their status, and retrieve results and logs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cette section explore comment utiliser `qiskit-ibm-catalog` pour lister les "
"programmes disponibles dans Qiskit Serverless, leur passer des entrées, les "
"exécuter à distance, vérifier leur statut et récupérer les résultats et les "
"journaux.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Be sure you have followed the workflow in [Write your first Qiskit "
"Serverless program](/guides/serverless-first-program) before you begin.\n"
msgstr ""
"Assure-toi d'avoir suivi le flux de travail décrit dans [Écrire ton premier "
"programme Qiskit Serverless](/guides/serverless-first-program) avant de "
"commencer.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "List programs available {#list-programs-available}"
msgstr "Lister les programmes disponibles {#list-programs-available}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use `QiskitServerless.list()` to fetch a list of the available "
"programs to run with Qiskit Serverless. This includes the previously "
"uploaded [`transpile_remote_serverless`](/guides/serverless-first-"
"program).\n"
msgstr ""
"Tu peux utiliser `QiskitServerless.list()` pour récupérer la liste des "
"programmes disponibles à exécuter avec Qiskit Serverless. Cela inclut le "
"programme [`transpile_remote_serverless`](/guides/serverless-first-program) "
"précédemment téléversé.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run an uploaded program and pass inputs {#run-an-uploaded-program-and-pass-"
"inputs}"
msgstr ""
"Exécuter un programme téléversé et lui passer des entrées {#run-an-uploaded-"
"program-and-pass-inputs}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, set up your inputs. Your program has three inputs: `circuits`, "
"`backend`, and `optimization_level`. You can use `random_circuit` to create "
"30 random circuits:\n"
msgstr ""
"D'abord, configure tes entrées. Ton programme attend trois entrées : "
"`circuits`, `backend` et `optimization_level`. Tu peux utiliser "
"`random_circuit` pour créer 30 circuits aléatoires :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/serverless-run-"
"first-workload/extracted-"
"outputs/46108a95-11f8-4ecf-83bb-131c3e7ea4c2-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Sortie de la cellule de code précédente](/docs/images/guides/serverless-"
"run-first-workload/extracted-"
"outputs/46108a95-11f8-4ecf-83bb-131c3e7ea4c2-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, use `QiskitRuntimeService` and `least_busy` to select a `backend`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ensuite, utilise `QiskitRuntimeService` et `least_busy` pour sélectionner un"
" `backend` :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set your optimization level:\n"
msgstr "Définis ton niveau d'optimisation :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Select your program with `serverless.load('PROGRAM_NAME')`:\n"
msgstr "Sélectionne ton programme avec `serverless.load('PROGRAM_NAME')` :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next, pass your inputs and run it in a pythonic fashion as follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ensuite, passe tes entrées et exécute-le de manière pythonique comme suit "
":\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"serverless-job-status\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"serverless-job-status\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Check job status {#check-job-status}"
msgstr "Vérifier le statut du job {#check-job-status}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"With your Qiskit Serverless `job_id`, you can check the status of running "
"jobs. This includes the following statuses:\n"
msgstr ""
"Avec le `job_id` de ton job Qiskit Serverless, tu peux vérifier le statut "
"des jobs en cours. Cela inclut les statuts suivants :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`QUEUED`**: The remote program is in the Qiskit Serverless queue. The "
"queue priority is currently based on how much you've used Qiskit "
"Serverless\n"
msgstr ""
"**`QUEUED`** : Le programme distant est dans la file d'attente de Qiskit "
"Serverless. La priorité de la file d'attente est actuellement basée sur ton "
"utilisation de Qiskit Serverless\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`INITIALIZING`**: The remote program is starting; this includes setting up"
" the remote environment and installing dependencies\n"
msgstr ""
"**`INITIALIZING`** : Le programme distant démarre ; cela inclut la "
"configuration de l'environnement distant et l'installation des dépendances\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`RUNNING`**: The program is running. At this stage, if you have `print()` "
"outputs in your program, you can retrieve logs using `job.logs()`\n"
msgstr ""
"**`RUNNING`** : Le programme est en cours d'exécution. À ce stade, si ton "
"programme contient des sorties `print()`, tu peux récupérer les journaux "
"avec `job.logs()`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`DONE`**: The program is complete, and you can retrieve data stored in "
"`save_result()` with `job.results()`\n"
msgstr ""
"**`DONE`** : Le programme est terminé, et tu peux récupérer les données "
"enregistrées dans `save_result()` avec `job.results()`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can also set more detailed job statuses in [Manage Qiskit Serverless "
"compute and data resources](/guides/serverless-manage-resources).\n"
msgstr ""
"Tu peux également définir des statuts de job plus détaillés dans [Gérer les "
"ressources de calcul et de données Qiskit Serverless](/guides/serverless-"
"manage-resources).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Currently, the IBM Quantum workloads table only reflects Qiskit Runtime workloads. Use `job.status()` to see your Qiskit Serverless workload's current status.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Actuellement, le tableau des charges de travail IBM Quantum ne reflète que les charges de travail Qiskit Runtime. Utilise `job.status()` pour voir le statut actuel de ta charge de travail Qiskit Serverless.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You've successfully run your first Qiskit Serverless program!\n"
msgstr "Tu as réussi à exécuter ton premier programme Qiskit Serverless !\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve logs and results {#retrieve-logs-and-results}"
msgstr "Récupérer les journaux et les résultats {#retrieve-logs-and-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As mentioned before, once a program is `RUNNING`, you can use `job.logs()` "
"to fetch logs created from `print()` outputs:\n"
msgstr ""
"Comme mentionné précédemment, une fois qu'un programme est en état "
"`RUNNING`, tu peux utiliser `job.logs()` pour récupérer les journaux créés à"
" partir des sorties `print()` :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "At any time, you can also cancel a job:\n"
msgstr "À tout moment, tu peux également annuler un job :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Once a program is `DONE`, you can use `job.results()` to fetch the result "
"stored in `save_result()`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Une fois qu'un programme est en état `DONE`, tu peux utiliser "
"`job.results()` pour récupérer le résultat enregistré dans `save_result()` "
":\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"List jobs previously run with Qiskit Serverless {#list-jobs-previously-run-"
"with-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr ""
"Lister les jobs précédemment exécutés avec Qiskit Serverless {#list-jobs-"
"previously-run-with-qiskit-serverless}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You can use `jobs()` to list all jobs submitted to Qiskit Serverless:\n"
msgstr ""
"Tu peux utiliser `jobs()` pour lister tous les jobs soumis à Qiskit "
"Serverless :\n"

